  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "cassius-quests-and-rewards",
      "title": {
        "en": "Cassius, Quests and Rewards"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_srt4",
              "name": "Pop Eyed Popper",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre1",
              "name": "Triple 0",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre11",
              "name": "Quest: Straight",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre12",
              "name": "Quest: Full House",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Cassius's gimmick is his Quests from Popper\nPopper has a pool of 4 Quests with different conditions required to finish\nQuest 0: Every 3 0 cost cards played, you get Triple 0\nQuest 1: Every 3 1 cost cards played, you get Triple 1\nStraight: Play a 0, 1 and 2 cost card to recieve Straight\nFull House: Play a card from every member of your team, recieve Full House\nMAX QUESTS YOU CAN COMPLETE PER TURN ARE 3"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre1",
              "name": "Triple 0",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre11",
              "name": "Quest: Straight",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1049_cre12",
              "name": "Quest: Full House",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Quest 0 is very easily spammable, so you can finish quests very easily for Moral\nQuest 1 required minimum of 3 AP per complete but its reward is okay now\nStraight: Hardest condition to finish, but 3 Moral can be very strong\nFull House: Relatively easy condition to finish and also good reward."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-4-patch-notes",
      "title": {
        "en": "2/4 Patch notes"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Cassius old style got removed\nBut every Quest 1 and straight got buffed heavy\nNot as nerfed as Tressa since Cassius can still be a Moral Engine"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Last Edit"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "8/6"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
